  <div class="modal-box" style="max-width: 400px; text-align: center">
    <span class="material-icons" style="font-size: 48px; color: var(--blue); margin-bottom: 15px">share</span>
    <h2>Compartilhar Portal</h2>
    <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 10px 0 20px">Como deseja compartilhar o portal de <strong id="nomePessoaShare" style="color: var(--text-primary)"></strong>?</p>
